# Reconciliation domain

Five source sheets (fuzzy-matched, skip Reconcilation/Queries): AIR COST TRN, CASH x SAle, CASH X Re, SPYJ SALE, SPJY Refund.

```
variance = cost_net - cashx_net - spyj_net
cost_net  = AIR COST TRN debit - credit
cashx_net = CASH x SAle - CASH X Re
spyj_net  = SPYJ SALE - SPJY Refund
```

Remarks: `|variance| < 1` → Matched; `| |variance| - 300 | <= 10` → Markup/Booking Charges; missing source → Not in Cost / Not in CASH X / Not in SPYJ (all missing labels kept); else Variance.

Store one `ReconciliationResult` per PNR and one `ReconciliationRemark` row per label. `remark` on the result is a comma-joined display cache.

Single-file: `POST /files/{id}/reconcile`. Multi-file: `reconcile_combined()` / `POST /files/reconcile-combined`. Keep column aliases in `_FIELD_ALIASES`; do not invent a mapping table unless asked.
